meta {
  name: 54-org-policies-settings
  seq: 54
}

docs {
  Policies and organization settings in the admin console: read and save a
  policy, read and rename the organization, collection management settings,
  the organization vault export, and deleting the organization. Needs
  `50-org-admin-setup`. Deleting the organization comes last.

  Policy types used here: 21 Send controls, the only type NodeWarden enforces,
  and 0 two-step login, which it refuses on purpose.
}
